Fitness Website – Complete MVP Documentation
Project type: Fitness, workout, health and wellness platform
Document: Product Requirements Document (PRD), UI/UX Specification, Technical Architecture and Development Roadmap
Target market: Nigeria and international users
Platform: Responsive website (desktop, tablet and mobile)
Recommended approach: Build a modern fitness platform where users can discover workout plans, follow exercise routines, track progress, access fitness resources and subscribe to premium programs.

1. Product overview
The fitness website will be a digital platform designed to help people improve their physical fitness, build healthy habits and achieve their fitness goals.

Users should be able to:

Create personal fitness accounts.

Choose fitness goals such as weight loss, muscle building, strength or general fitness.

Access workout programs and exercise tutorials.

Follow daily and weekly workout schedules.

Track workout activities and fitness progress.

Read nutrition and wellness articles.

Subscribe to premium fitness programs.

Manage their profiles and subscriptions.

The website will have an administration dashboard where the business owner can manage users, workout programs, exercises, subscriptions, articles and platform activities.

Product vision
Create an accessible, professional and engaging fitness platform that makes fitness guidance easier to access, understand and follow.

2. Three possible design and product directions
These are three distinct directions worth considering before implementation.

