My recommendation is to launch FitPro with these three priorities:

Priority 1 – Excellent workout experience

Make finding and following workouts extremely easy. This is the central reason users should return to FitPro.

Priority 2 – Meaningful progress tracking

Give members a reason to continue training by showing completed workouts, weekly activity and goal progress.

Priority 3 – Sustainable premium membership

